OL,3,GNEWSAYouTuber gets his childhood
OL,4,AChristmas wish granted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPodcasters with over a million
OL,7,Fsubscribers have said they will be
OL,8,Fticking off a bucket list dream by
OL,9,Fswitching on a city's Christmas lights.
OL,11,FJack Dean, 33, best known from Jaack
OL,12,FMaate's Happy Hour podcast on YouTube,
OL,13,Fand his co-hosts Stevie White, 33, and
OL,14,FRobbie Knox, 49, will be the star
OL,15,Fguests at Norwich's annual switch-on.
OL,17,FThe comedy show has seen high-profile
OL,18,Fguests such as Ricky Gervais, Romesh
OL,19,FRanganathan and Richard Osman join the
OL,20,FNorfolk-based trio.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
